    description: 'For over 20 years, the Visual Effects Society has had an award for \'Outstanding Visual Effects in a Real Time Project\'. Only 9 people, worldwide have won this category multiple times. Join us as these outstanding artists and leaders discuss their work, thoughts, planning and execution of the best effects in the world, and how they navigated their careers such that they positioned themselves at studios that are accomplishing the best work in the industry, worthy of realizing a VES award.',
