    title: 'Using Telemetry (the Right Way) is a Game-Changer for Game Tools',
    description: 'Telemetry can be a game-changer in helping you develop better tools, but without watching users work, it can also be deeply misleading. Using real-world examples, this talk offers practical and actionable advice on what telemetry can and cannot tell you, what to consider when adding a telemetry system to your tools, and how to use it to track improvements to the user experience of your tools over time.',
    speakers: ['David Lightbown(Ubisoft)'],
