    description: 'Ensuring games are available across multiple platforms is increasingly essential in an age where game budgets and competition for player attention continues to cinrease. However, this creates issues when trying to port assets between platforms with large variations in specification. The team behind PC and Mobile hit Delta Force have created tools and processes that dramatically speak up the coversion of assets from PC to mobile, without impact to visible asset quality, game performance and without needing a large increase in project staff.',
