    title: 'Implementing a Built-In Multiplayer UGC Experience in \'Genshin Impact\'',
    description: 'Miliastra Wonderland, Genshin Impact\'s new User-Generated Content (UGC) gameplay module, is built directly into the game rather than as a separate application. This design maximizes the reuse and portability of existing, actively updated Genshin Impact content within Miliastra Wonderland, boosting both the development cycle and long-term UGC creation. This talk explores the technical framework for implementing UGC on top of Genshin Impact\'s existing architecture, highlighting its effectiveness and the challenges of maintaining performance when development focus shifts from a single-player, developer-crafted foundation to a multiplayer UGC environment. Attendees gain insights into design decisions, optimization strategies, and best practices for enabling rich, player-created experiences in a large-scale live service.',
