    description: 'Wrap up your Independent Games Summit experience at \'Indie Unwind\', a relaxed, informal session-into-gathering led by the Independent Games Summit Chairs, designed exclusively for indie game developers. Following the thought-provoking Indie Soapbox session, this is your chance to slow down, unwind, and prepare yourself for the rest of GDC week. Connect with fellow indie devs, exchange ideas, share your experiences, or simply decompress in a welcoming and supportive environment. Let\'s celebrate our community, create new friendships, and recharge before heading back into the world of indie game creation.',
