    title: 'G.A.N.G. Demo Derby: Sound Design',
    description: 'The G.A.N.G. Sound Design Demo Derby is a longstanding tradition at GDC, and has been a cornerstone event for new and emerging audio professionals. Attendees can submit 120 seconds of their best work for a detailed critique and feedback from a team of leading audio directors and professionals. They can also participate in an active discussion with fellow panelists and audience members. The Derby is open to GDC attendees across all disciplines. Attendees can submit their demos using the following link: https://www.audiogang.org/demo-derby-submission/ (https://www.audiogang.org/demo-derby-submission/)',
