    description: 'Marvel Rivals achieved 10 million players signing up within 72 hours of its December 2024 launch. Within three months, the game had over 40 million users, peaking at 644,000 concurrent players on Steam. The Publishing and Marketing Director of Marvel Rivals unveils the operational strategies behind this success, establishing Marvel Rivals as a premier live-service hero shooter. Attendees gain actionable frameworks for building player-centric communities through real-time sentiment tracking and co-creation tools; executing effective publishing aligned with the IP lore; optimizing content cadence and transforming monetization through transparent systems; and enabling live-ops agility via cross-functional team synchronization. These methodologies provide a replicable blueprint for launching and sustaining hit live-service games.',
