    description: 'AI is already transforming games—but most studios are stuck on chatbots and concept art. At Alibaba Cloud, we help developers embed real intelligence across their entire pipeline: dynamic NPCs with Qwen, auto-generated worlds with Wan, AI-driven QA, and live-ops powered by real-time player analytics—all running on a global cloud infrastructure built for gaming. In this session, you\'ll see real, production-ready examples from studios using: ● Qwen-Agents to generate quests, dialogue, and terrain ● AI that tests like a human—but never sleeps ● Predictive systems that boost retention and reduce churn Plus, learn how our global network (US, EU, APAC, MEA) delivers sub-50ms latency, auto-scales at launch, and cuts cloud costs by up to 40%. Leave with practical ways to add AI to your existing stack—and scale globally without compromise.',
