    id: 'tue-062',
    title: 'AI Trends of Today and Opportunities for Tomorrow: Ask Me Anything',
    description: 'Bubble or not, machine learning is here, and it works. Advanced techniques in Machine Learning have already been widely applied in the video game industry, powering products that are available on the market today, such as Nvidia DLSS and Bandai Namco Tekken8 \'Super Ghost Battle\' system. From content creation to runtime optimization and the underlying fabric of live service features, Machine Learning is increasingly becoming the solution to the problems many developers face. In fact, it has the potential to the whole video games industry by storm in the coming years, in many disruptive ways. For leaders and investors, it\'s essential to understand where we are, and where this technology is going. Esteemed industry leader Julien Merceron will share not only his own insights and opinions on the trends and futures of Machine Learning, but the voices of many other industry experts. This session is designed to prioritize YOUR questions, offering a unique opportunity to explore trends, challenges, and opportunities in an open forum. Join us for an hour of discussion, this session is all yours! Ask anything!',
