    description: 'Insiders leaking gaming artwork, plots, characters, trailers, launch information, pricing, and more is a chronic, pervasive, and highly damaging problem throughout the industry. EchoMark, through its use of steganography, has developed an exciting new way to combat these leaks. See a live demo of content leaked through a digital copy/fragment, a camera photo of a computer screen, or even manually re-typed into another computer and how the source can be immediately identified.',
