    title: 'Fight and Ye Shall Receive: How CWA\'s Game Worker Union Campaigns Are Changing the Industry! (Presented by Campaign to Organize Digital Employees (CODE-CWA))',
    description: 'Over the last few years, thousands of game workers across the US and Canada have won certified unions and bargained first contracts at major game studios like Bethesda, Blizzard, SEGA, Paizo, and more with the Communications Workers of America (CWA)! Last year at GDC 2025, the industry also saw the launch of United Videogame Workers (CWA Local 9433), a direct-to-join union established with CWA open to any game worker in North America. As the industry continues to face unprecedented times, CWA game union members have returned to GDC to discuss the historic rise of the game industry labor movement, how unions are making positive changes in our industry, and visions for the future! If you\'ve ever wondered about the specifics of how unionization could change or benefit your workplace and our whole industry, this talk is for you! A moderated audience Q&A session will follow!',
