    id: 'wed-150',
    title: 'Pains of Growth: Level Up Your Tracking and Pipeline (Presented by Twisted Mountain Animation)',
    description: 'Growth is every studio\'s goal. As teams scale and productions become more complex, production management often turns into a bottleneck, slowing teams down instead of powering them forward. This fast-paced session challenges long-held assumptions about how production tracking and pipelines should work in modern studios. Drawing on real-world studio experience, the talk unpacks the most common pains of growth—from fragmented data and manual workarounds to pipelines that can\'t keep up with complex projects. Attendees get an inside look at Envisage, a new approach to production management designed to level up how studios plan, track, and execute work, while leveraging data to increase visibility and drive smarter, faster decision-making across projects and teams. Expect practical insights, concrete examples, and a fresh perspective on how rethinking production management can unlock clarity, scalability, and momentum as studios grow.',
