    id: 'thu-014',
    title: 'First Day to First Win: Build Your Onboarding Strategy',
    description: 'Onboarding doesn\'t have to be confusing, inconsistent, or quietly miserable; but too often, it is. We\'ve all experienced that moment as a new hire: sitting alone, unsure of what to do next, and wondering if anyone even knows we started. This session introduces a practical framework called the Six Pillars of Impactful Onboarding, then quickly shifts into a collaborative, hands-on mini-workshop. Attendees will reflect on their own onboarding practices, swap insights with peers, and build a realistic strategy to take back to their team or studio. Whether you\'re a lead, director, or passionate teammate who wants to improve how new hires get started, you\'ll leave with something you can actually use and maybe even a few new connections, too!',
