    description: 'Computer Lunch\'s game \'Cell to Singularity\' is a success. Amazing! Now what? Should they jump right into a new project? Create an expansion? Make a sequel? They look around the games industry and realize, the answer might be yes to all of those. This talk describes how a small, self funded indie team with no experience in LiveOps ends up turning a game that takes six weeks to beat into an evergreen LiveOps title. They break down what that looks like on the ground, and describe the challenges a developer might encounter along the way.',
