    title: 'Kickflipping Without Bailing on Frame Rate: Graphics Optimization in \'Tony Hawk\'s Pro Skater 3+4\'',
    description: 'Iron Galaxy Studios took up the challenge of delivering a visually impressive remaster in Tony Hawk\'s Pro Skater 3+4. Their goal was to breathe new life into the franchise with an update that looked stunning on newer consoles but was still a great game with rock solid framerates on last-gen platforms. Jon Moore, the game\'s lead rendering engineer, will share details on tile classified shading optimizations, automated performance testing, analysis, and a case study of working with artists to optimize a level. This exploration will be supported by examples of some of the many optimizations the team identified as they analyzed the content across the game\'s many SKUs.',
