    title: 'Performance Capture in the Trenches: \'Battlefield 6\' Cinematics',
    description: 'Massive destruction, military vehicles, and cinematic chaos — that\'s what fans know as the Battlefield experience. How does one translate it to a clean, soundproof MoCap stage without breaking immersion for the actors? All while adapting to evolving creative direction and meeting a high bar for realism? And doing it all on a tight schedule? Pasha recaps EA Create Capture\'s methods behind Battlefield 6\'s cinematics, from building immersive physical sets to real-time virtual production workflows. Now that the battle is over, he reflects on team dynamics and tough leadership lessons learned under the pressure of large-scale production.',
