    id: 'thu-170',
    title: 'Scaling Playtesting Reach with GeForce NOW (Presented by NVIDIA)',
    description: 'The GeForce NOW Developer Portal is streamlining playtesting by providing global, secure access to pre-release builds without the need for downloads or high-end local hardware. In this session, we will dive into the new \'Install-to-Play\' (I2P) mode, where developers can now stream their games on day one without any content adaptation. This streamlined workflow allows teams to quickly configure custom tests or utilize the I2P Test App to install and play any Steam title—including beta branches—while observing live sessions remotely. These tools eliminate legacy barriers, allowing developers to move from installation to live cloud-based testing and observation in record time.',
