    title: '\'Genshin Impact\' Miliastra Wonderland: Co-Creating a Virtual World with Users',
    description: 'This talk will first outline the rationale behind the development of Miliastra Wonderland, Genshin Impact\'s in-game user-generated content (UGC) gameplay module, as well as the project team\'s vision for the module including the content the team aims to cultivate and the support it intends to provide. Next, it will reveal the design considerations for the core functionalities of Miliastra Wonderland, detailing the technical challenges the team has overcome and the implementation process by stages. Finally, it will discuss the future development roadmap for Miliastra Wonderland, along with the team\'s plans for integrating PCG and AI functionalities.',
