    title: 'Press Startup: How to Raise Serious Funds, Ship Killer Products and Build Lasting Value like a Tech Business',
    description: 'Why do trending tech companies seem to attract extravagant funding where viable games studios can struggle? Does the tech world really know anything we don\'t and - if so - can we steal their ideas? This is a unique opportunity to hear from veteran games professionals who have made the treacherous leap into tech, working on everything from world-class distribution platforms to pioneering medical technology. Find out what the startup ecosystem can teach the games industry about funding, pitching, product management, exit strategies and more. The panel will even probe the most unspeakable question of all: should you consider starting a tech business yourself?',
