    title: 'Canceled: Behind the Scenes: The Making of a Gameplay Trailer',
    description: 'This presentation invites attendees to step into the shoes of a \'Gameplay Capture\' team, experiencing the game trailer creation process from marketing brief to final delivery with opportunities for audience collaboration at key points in the talk. Attendees will be shown capture session footage and other real documents and clips demonstrating how a Capture Team is structured, its typical processes and some of the wider trailer workflows and collaboration required to create compelling gameplay sequences live in game while navigating technical constraints and rapidly evolving game content. We\'ll look at breaking down the marketing brief, creative ideation, and the iteration, tools and processes that go into individual shots and sequences during trailer production. The session showcases game capture as the specialized discipline it is, combining creative visual storytelling and technical problem-solving with cinematography and gameplay, exposing attendees to the wide variety of techniques used in Gameplay Capture.',
