    id: 'fri-091',
    title: 'Canceled: Connection and Creativity at Scale: Inside King\'s 1,000-Person Game Jam',
    description: 'Go behind-the-scenes of King\'s company-wide Feature Jam - an AI-powered event that brought together over 1,000 employees across disciplines and countries to prototype new in-game features. From junior talent to the company\'s senior leadership, everyone got involved, showing how AI can be democratized in a fun way. Designed to lower barriers between technical and non-technical roles, the Jam paired AI tools with expert guidance, enabling all to participate meaningfully. The result was a pipeline of playable prototypes with real business potential to kickstart discovery for future features in King\'s biggest titles. This session explores how AI can serve as both a force multiplier for organizers and a creative co-pilot for teams - raising the ceiling of what could be built in just four hours. You\'ll learn what worked, what didn\'t, and how to design your own inclusive, high-impact, AI-powered innovation events at scale.',
